          sell entries to a leaderboard with a payout. The terms in the
          "fantasy" and "simulator" parts of the name are deliberate: this is a
          free browser soccer game with no download where the only stake is
          bragging rights among friends. If you are looking for daily fantasy
          sports or any real-money contest, this is not that product, and we
          urge you to use a licensed operator in your region instead. Because
          the interactive soccer simulator is non-commercial, it is also suitable
          for classrooms and family use in a way a paid game is not. We may add
          shared, non-cash challenges later — for example comparing cups with
          friends — but they will never involve money, and any such feature would
          be described clearly before you used it. A world cup simulator should
          stay a safe, free place to play, and this clause is the line that keeps
          the online soccer game and the fantasy soccer draft free of wagering,
          whether you found it as a soccer draft game, a free soccer simulation
          game, or simply the easiest interactive soccer simulator to open on a
          phone.
        </p>
